<div>
  Run approval workflow, just-in-time change permissions, and append-only audit
  history for Jenkins instances that are used as a batch execution manager.
  Manual runs of protected jobs require an approval by a designated approver,
  job configuration changes require a time-boxed permission grant, and every
  run, change, and failure is recorded independently of build retention.
</div>
